                        "review": "This game was so fun when it came out!\n\nI don't really get all the negative reviews saying the devs \"abandoned\" the game. \n\nBack in 2016 it was normal for developers to \"release\" a game - unheard of concept today I guess. \nThey even dropped a free update with more enemies, weapons, etc after release which was nice.\n\nGame is a bit dated by modern standards, but it's been 10 years! If you want a rogue-lite souls-lite fun little game with coop you could do a lot worse.",
